{%- comment -%}
  SHUDHI — Header / transparent overlay nav

  The sticky element is the Shopify section wrapper (schema "class":
  "sh-header-sticky"), not this <header>: position:sticky can only stick
  within its own parent's box, so sticking the inner element would unstick
  it the moment its short wrapper scrolled away. The wrapper also carries a
  negative margin-bottom equal to the header height, which pulls the hero up
  underneath for the overlay effect — no absolute/fixed switch, no jump.

  Fonts are NOT loaded here. Cormorant Garamond + Jost are already fetched
  globally by snippets/engo-header-fonts.liquid (theme.liquid:79).
  shudhi-home.css / .js are loaded from layout/theme.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
{%- assign menu = linklists[s.menu] -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The transparent-over-hero treatment only makes sense on the homepage; every
  other template has no hero behind the nav, so it renders solid from scroll 0
  and data-always-solid tells scrollState() not to strip the class.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign sh_overlay = false -%}
{%- if s.overlay and template.name == 'index' -%}{%- assign sh_overlay = true -%}{%- endif -%}

<header class="sh sh-header{% unless sh_overlay %} is-solid{% endunless %}"
        data-solid-after="{{ s.solid_after }}"
        {% unless sh_overlay %}data-always-solid="true"{% endunless %}
        role="banner">
  <div class="sh-header__inner">

    {%- comment -%} Logo {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Logo falls back in three steps: merchant upload -> the derived cream
      transparent PNG -> the inline SVG lockup.

      shudhi-logo-light.png is the MARK ONLY (no "SHUDHI HERBALS" wordmark),
      derived from "SHUDHI HERBALS LOGO.jpg.jpeg" in the theme root. That source
      is a 4500x4500 JPEG: white background, forest-green #335030 strokes and a
      brown #785b3b dot, with the art filling only the middle 43% x 31%. Used
      raw it would render as a white box on the transparent nav (JPEG carries no
      alpha), vanish against the solid #1b2411 bar, and shrink to a third of its
      proper size because the square whitespace counts toward the height cap.
      The derived PNG is therefore trimmed to the ink bbox, keyed to
      transparency, and flattened to cream --sh-light — which is the one
      treatment that reads on BOTH header states. Regenerate it the same way if
      the source artwork changes.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="sh-logo" aria-label="{{ shop.name | escape }} — home">
      {%- if s.logo != blank -%}
        <img class="sh-logo__img" src="{{ s.logo | image_url: width: 440 }}"
             alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}" width="440" height="327" loading="eager">
      {%- elsif s.use_asset_logo -%}
        {%- comment -%} 562x400 = the PNG's real intrinsic size. It must match the
            file exactly: --sh-logo-h caps the height and width is auto, so these
            attributes are what reserves the box and keeps the nav from shifting
            while the image decodes. {%- endcomment -%}
        <img class="sh-logo__img" src="{{ 'shudhi-logo-light.png' | asset_url }}"
             alt="{{ shop.name | escape }}" width="562" height="400" loading="eager">
      {%- else -%}
        {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'shudhi-mark', class: 'sh-logo__mark' %}
        <span class="sh-logo__text">
          <b>{{ s.brand_name }}</b>
          <small>{{ s.brand_sub }}</small>
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
    </a>

    {%- comment -%} Desktop nav {%- endcomment -%}
    <nav class="sh-nav" aria-label="Primary">
      {%- if menu != blank and menu.links.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for link in menu.links -%}
          <a href="{{ link.url }}"{% if link.active %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ link.title }}</a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Built-in menu. config/settings_data.json stores "menu": "", so the
          linklist above is inert and THIS is what actually renders. Keep it in
          sync with the drawer copy at :129 — the two are deliberately separate
          so the drawer can diverge later, but today they must match.

          Journal is a LABEL-only rename of the old "Blog"; the URL is untouched
          so inbound links and SEO survive. Ingredients (#ritual-benefits) and
          Reviews (#collection) were dropped from the top level: the benefits
          grid now lives on /pages/the-ritual and the collection carousel is
          reachable via Shop. Durable fix for all of this: build main-menu in
          Navigation and select it in this section's settings.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
        <a href="/products/negativity-removal-cleansing-bar">Shop</a>
        <a href="/pages/our-story">Our Story</a>
        <a href="/pages/the-ritual">The Ritual</a>
        <a href="{{ blog.url | default: '/blogs/news' }}">Journal</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </nav>

    {%- comment -%} Actions {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="sh-actions">
      <a href="{{ routes.search_url }}" data-sh-search aria-label="Search">
        {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'search', sw: 1.1 %}
      </a>

      <a href="{{ routes.account_url }}" aria-label="Account">
        {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'user', sw: 1.1 %}
      </a>

      {%- comment -%}
        .enj-cartcount is the theme's own count hook (ajaxCartConfig in
        theme.liquid). The click is handled by cart() in assets/shudhi-home.js:
        it opens the minicart drawer in place; the href stays as the no-JS
        fallback. .js-call-minicart is kept for quickview.js, which triggers
        it — its own legacy handler in engo-scripts never binds because that
        ready block throws earlier.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" class="sh-cart js-call-minicart" aria-label="Cart">
        {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'cart', sw: 1.1 %}
        <span class="sh-cart__count enj-cartcount{% if cart.item_count == 0 %} hidden-count{% endif %}">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
      </a>

      <button type="button" class="sh-burger" data-drawer-open
              aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sh-drawer">
        {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'menu' %}
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</header>

{%- comment -%} Mobile drawer {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="sh sh-overlay" data-drawer-close></div>

<aside class="sh sh-drawer" id="sh-drawer" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Menu">
  <div class="sh-drawer__top">
    <span class="sh-logo">
      {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'shudhi-mark', class: 'sh-logo__mark' %}
      <span class="sh-logo__text"><b>{{ s.brand_name }}</b><small>{{ s.brand_sub }}</small></span>
    </span>
    <button type="button" data-drawer-close aria-label="Close menu">
      {% render 'sh-icon', name: 'close' %}
    </button>
  </div>

  <nav class="sh-drawer__nav" aria-label="Mobile">
    {%- if menu != blank and menu.links.size > 0 -%}
      {%- for link in menu.links -%}
        <a href="{{ link.url }}">{{ link.title }}</a>
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%} Must match the desktop fallback at :70. {%- endcomment -%}
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
      <a href="/products/negativity-removal-cleansing-bar">Shop</a>
      <a href="/pages/our-story">Our Story</a>
      <a href="/pages/the-ritual">The Ritual</a>
      <a href="{{ blog.url | default: '/blogs/news' }}">Journal</a>
      <a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </nav>
</aside>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "SH · Header",
  "class": "sh-header-sticky",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Logo image",
      "info": "Leave empty to use the built-in Shudhi mark + wordmark." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "use_asset_logo", "label": "Use the built-in logo image", "default": true,
      "info": "Uses shudhi-logo-light.png from Assets when no logo is uploaded above. Uncheck to fall back to the text lockup." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_name", "label": "Brand name", "default": "SHUDHI" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_sub", "label": "Brand sub-line", "default": "HERBALS" },
    { "type": "link_list", "id": "menu", "label": "Menu", "default": "main-menu",
      "info": "Falls back to a built-in menu if empty." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Behaviour" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "overlay", "label": "Transparent over the hero", "default": true },
    { "type": "range", "id": "solid_after", "label": "Turn solid after (px scrolled)", "min": 20, "max": 400, "step": 10, "default": 90 }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "SH · Header" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
